etric 更好的工具是哪个哈？后面有介绍吗？ ELK能做CAT的功能吗？谢谢～","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":474826,"discussion_content":"Metric监控目前主流的产品是promethues(https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus)。\n\nELK理论上可以作为CAT的存储(据了解，CAT作者有尝试将CAT存储从HDFS替换为ELK)，但是ELK应该还不能代替CAT的功能。两者是不同产品，CAT专注调用链监控，而ELK专注日志监控(也可以做大数据存储和分析)。","content_length":182,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1574080157,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":149267,"user_name":"黑山老妖","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1115958,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A1659F99C5BE1E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/07/36/d677e741.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1573180726,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":57426,"content":"skywalking是国人开发产品，有apache背书，在国内社区生态比较好，目前在github上skywalking的stars已经超越pinpoint。\n\n调用链产品要用好，一般需要一定的源码定制能力，比如定制plugin等。\n\n我在极客时间的每日一课有一个分享视频《CAT、Zipkin和SkyWalking该如何选型？》，里头有主流产品比较和选型建议，可以参考。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1573212397,"ip_address":"","comment_id":149267,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"老师，请教一个问题：skywalking与pinport都不需要修改代码，对于系统侵入性小，我们公司想采用，对比其他产品有没有不好的地方需要注意？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"rep